  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5751e45b3bc551448917ed569792a2a2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 19
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: The temperature is getting unbearable. We are being forced to retreat\ndeeper
    and deeper as the water evaporates at unbelievable speeds.\nProima has never
    lived through something like this before. All the\nnatural disasters that hit
    this planet can not compare to this. I just hope\nwe actually get to live through
    it.\nAll the research I have done has been useless. I am scared mom.
